        "question": "<div class=\"question\" dir=\"rtl\">در ذوزنقۀ <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle ABCD $</span> ، پاره‌خط <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle BE $</span> موازی قطر <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle AC $</span> است. اگر <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle AD=7 $</span> و <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle AE=3 $</span> باشد، فاصلۀ <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle MD $</span> کدام است؟<div class=\"floatLeft\"><img src=\"https://www.monta.ir/render?id=28958\"> </div>&nbsp;</div>",
        "mediaHasRequested": false,
        "topics": "{\"idList\":[{\"id\":32646}]}",
