        "choice4selectedCounts": 45,
        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\">کافی است دو بار از قضیۀ تالس استفاده کنیم:<br><div align=\"left\"><table class=\"layoutdualColumn\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"dualColumnFirstCell\" align=\"right\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.monta.ir/render?id=719835\"><br></td><td class=\"dualColumnSecondCell\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;<span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{ll}<br>&nbsp; &amp; M\\overset{\\,\\,\\Delta }{\\mathop{A}}\\,C:BE\\left\\| AC \\right.\\,\\,\\,\\xrightarrow{\\text{تالس}}\\frac{ME}{AE}=\\frac{MB}{BC} \\\\ <br>&nbsp;&amp; M\\overset{\\,\\Delta }{\\mathop{D\\,}}\\,C:AB\\left\\| CD \\right.\\xrightarrow{\\text{تالس}}\\frac{MA}{AD}=\\frac{MB}{BC} \\\\ <br>\\end{array} \\right.\\,\\Rightarrow \\frac{ME}{AE}=\\frac{MA}{AD}$</span> <br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div align=\"left\">&nbsp;<span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle \\Rightarrow \\frac{x}{3}=\\frac{x+3}{7}\\Rightarrow 7x=3x+9\\Rightarrow 4x=9\\Rightarrow x=2.25$</span></div>درنتیجه: &nbsp; <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle MD=2.25+3+7=12.25$</span><br></div>",
