        "isExamSingleQuestion": false,
        "choice4selectedCounts": 118,
        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\"><table class=\"layoutdualColumn\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"dualColumnFirstCell\"><div align=\"right\">دو مثلث&nbsp; <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle AMD $</span>&nbsp; و <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle BMN $</span>&nbsp; و همچنین دو مثلث&nbsp; <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle AMB $</span> و <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle DMP&nbsp; $</span> با هم متشابه‌اند. داریم:</div><div align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle \\begin{array}{ll}<br>&nbsp; &amp; \\left. \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp; &amp; \\overset{\\Delta}{AMD}\\sim \\overset{\\Delta}{BMN}:\\frac{MN}{AM}=\\frac{BM}{MD} \\\\ <br>&nbsp;&amp; \\overset{\\Delta}{AMB}\\sim \\overset{\\Delta}{DMP}:\\frac{BM}{MD}=\\frac{AM}{MP} \\\\ <br>\\end{matrix} \\right\\}\\Rightarrow \\frac{MN}{AM}=\\frac{AM}{MP} \\\\ <br>&nbsp;&amp; \\Rightarrow A{{M}^{2}}=MN\\times MP \\\\ <br>\\end{array}$</span> </div></td><td class=\"dualColumnSecondCell\" align=\"left\"><img src=\"https://www.monta.ir/render?id=28877\"> <br></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
