        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدا توسط فیثاغورس اندازۀ <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle OB$</span>\nرا به‌دست می‌آوریم:<br><div align=\"left\"><div align=\"right\"><table class=\"layoutdualColumn\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"dualColumnFirstCell\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.monta.ir/render?id=58395\"></td><td class=\"dualColumnSecondCell\" align=\"left\"><div align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle \\begin{array}{ll} &amp;OB=\\sqrt{4-1}=\\sqrt{3} \\\\&amp;\\left.\\begin{array}{ll} \\hat {O_{1}}=\\hat {O_{2}}\\\\&nbsp;\\hat{A}=\\hat{B} \\end{array}\\right\\}\\Rightarrow \\overset {\\Delta}{AOA'}\\sim \\overset {\\Delta}{OBB'}\\\\&amp;\\Rightarrow \\frac {AA'}{BB'}=\\frac {A'O}{OB'}=\\frac {AO}{OB}\\Rightarrow \\frac {x}{2}=\\frac {1}{\\sqrt {3}}\\Rightarrow x=\\frac {2\\sqrt {3}}{3} \\end{array}$</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>",
